---
// https://www.protelsystems.cz/sk/demo-zadarmo (Solid Pixels), port 1:1 skriptem port-protel.py
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base
  title="DEMO ZADARMO | Hotel PMS Protel"
  description="Ponúkame konzultácie v oblasti identifikácie potrieb vašej hotelovej prevádzky a následnej prípravy ideálneho komplexného riešenia. Kontaktujte našich konzultantov a zistite, ako vám môže spoločnosť Protel pomôcť."
  path="/sk/demo-zadarmo"
  bodyClass="use-header-transparent use-menu-secondary-uppercase use-menu-button-uppercase use-headings-link-plain search-panel-hide-submit-label search-panel-hide-close-label search-panel-hide-open-label use-menu-bar use-header-fixed use-header-fixed-mobile use-header-priority use-header-boxed i-want-protel"
  locale="sk"
  image="/files/4317-nahled-chci-protel.jpg"
>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default section-has-background" id="lead-form"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-5-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h1 class="h2-style">Zistite, prečo je Protel taký obľúbený a aké výhody môže priniesť do vášho hotela alebo penziónu. <span class="text-highlight">Ozvite sa nám.</span></h1>
</div>
<form action="https://databridge.pianopos.cz/api/web-lead" autocomplete="off" class="block block-form form-background" data-lead-form="formular-odoslat-formular" id="formular-odoslat-formular" method="post">
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_input_email" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-wrapper-e-mail">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<label for="formular-odoslat-formular-field-e-mail" id="formular-odoslat-formular-label-e-mail">
            E-mail <span>*</span>
</label>
<input class="field-control" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-e-mail" name="formular-odoslat-formular[e-mail]" required="" type="email" value=""/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_input_tel" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-wrapper-telefon">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<label for="formular-odoslat-formular-field-telefon" id="formular-odoslat-formular-label-telefon">
            Telefón
          </label>
<input class="field-control" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-telefon" name="formular-odoslat-formular[telefon]" type="tel" value=""/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_input_text" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-wrapper-vasa-sprava">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<label for="formular-odoslat-formular-field-vasa-sprava" id="formular-odoslat-formular-label-vasa-sprava">
            Vaša správa
          </label>
<input class="field-control" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-vasa-sprava" name="formular-odoslat-formular[vasa-sprava]" type="text" value=""/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field-form_agreement-text" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-wrapper-field_formular-odoslat-formular_3_0_0">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<div class="block block-inline">
<p>Vaše osobné údaje budú spracované v súlade s <a href="/sk/podmienky-spracovania-osobnych-udajov-formular">Podmienkami spracovania osobných údajov</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_button" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-wrapper-odoslat-formular">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<div class="left">
<button class="btn btn-a btn-default" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-odoslat-formular" name="formular-odoslat-formular[odoslat-formular]" type="submit" value="submit"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">ODOSLAŤ FORMULÁR</span></button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<input name="form_variant" type="hidden" value="formular-odoslat-formular"/><input name="page" type="hidden" value=""/><div aria-hidden="true" class="visually-hidden"><label>Web <input autocomplete="off" name="website" tabindex="-1" type="text"/></label></div></form>
</div> <div class="col col-6-12 grid-1-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:50px"></div></div></div> <div class="col col-7-12 grid-6-12"><div class="block block-image"><div class="image image-mask ratio-original" style="padding-bottom:114.28571428571428%"><img alt="" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width:1390px) 695px, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/protel-setri-cas-penize.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/protel-setri-cas-penize.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/protel-setri-cas-penize.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/protel-setri-cas-penize.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:30px"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:#fff"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default col-gaps-bigger section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h2 class="center">Protel používajú tí najlepší<span class="text-highlight">.</span></h2>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:30px"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-gallery grid-sm-2"><div class="grid gallery-container" style="--gap:40px"><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Grandhotel Starý Smokovec" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-grandhotel-stary-smokovec-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Clarion Hotel" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-clarion-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Tatralandia" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-tatralandia-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Mamaison" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-mamaison-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch"><img alt="Logo Hotel Yasmin" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-hotel-yasmin-black.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Vaše logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-vasa-2025.svg"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Marián Madara" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/marian-madara.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/marian-madara.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/marian-madara.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/marian-madara.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">
Podiel priameho online predaja neustále zvyšujeme aj vďaka možnostiam dynamickej cenotvorby a prepojenia s CRM, ktoré systém Protel umožňuje.
</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Marián Madara <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">TMR Hotels, PMS Master User, Department management</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Iveta Spáčilová" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/iveta-spacilova.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/iveta-spacilova.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/iveta-spacilova.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/iveta-spacilova.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Protel je najlepší systém, aký sme si mohli priať. Vďaka nemu a skvelému tímu technickej podpory posúvame náš rezort vpred. Ďakujeme vám a odporúčame.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Iveta Spáčilová <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Resort Sobotín, Sales Manager</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-9-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Miroslav Bukva" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/miroslav-bukva.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/miroslav-bukva.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Výber správneho softvéru pre hotel nie je jednoduchý, pretože rôzne typy hotelov majú rôzne potreby. Pre veľký hotel s konferenčným centrom je ideálne robustné riešenie PMS PROTEL. Protel je vynikajúci z hľadiska výkonu aj ceny a dôležitou vlastnosťou je, samozrejme, veľmi dobrá podpora.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Miroslav Bukva <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Aquapalace Hotel Prague, General Manager</span></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-button"><div class="center"><a class="btn btn-default btn-sm" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo#lead-form"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">CHCEM TIEŽ PROTEL</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-spacer"><div class="block-spacer-element" style="--height:50px"></div></div></div></div></div></div>
</Base>
